### 1. Reserva exitosa
POST http://localhost:8081/api/inventory/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaccionId": "TX-1001",
  "productoId": "PROD-001",
  "cantidad": 3
}

### 2. Reintento con mismo transaccionId
POST http://localhost:8081/api/inventory/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaccionId": "TX-1001",
  "productoId": "PROD-001",
  "cantidad": 3
}

### 3. Stock insuficiente (409)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/inventory/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaccionId": "TX-1002",
  "productoId": "PROD-003",
  "cantidad": 5
}

### 4. Liberar reserva (Compensación)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/inventory/release
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaccionId": "TX-1001"
}